
---

## 📄 `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Virtual Environment
venv/
env/
.venv/
ENV/

# Python Cache
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.pyd

# Data Files
data/
*.db
*.sqlite3

# Environment Variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# IDE Files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# OS Files
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.directory

# Distribution
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
*.egg

# Testing
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Temporary Files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.mp3
*.wav